Package: SimMSAR
Type: Project
Title: Simulation and Estimation of Markov-Switching Autoregressive Models for Network Dynamics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("[NAME]", email = "[EMAIL]", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This project implements simulation and estimation of Markov-Switching
    Autoregressive (MSAR) models for network dynamics using the NHMSAR package. It
    provides tools for generating synthetic network time-series data with regime-switching
    dynamics and estimating MSAR models to recover the underlying network structures.
